{"name":"Paramount","hex":"#5b6161","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Paramount","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in Los Angeles County, California, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Paramount"}],"entries":[{"title":"Paramount Skydance","blocks":[{"text":"Skydance Corporation is an American multinational mass media and entertainment conglomerate headquartered at One Astor Plaza in New York City. The company was formed on August 7, 2025, through the merger of Skydance Media and Paramount Global. On October 6, 2026, it was renamed from Paramount Skydance Corporation to Skydance Corporation after the acquisition of Warner Bros. Discovery."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Times_Sq_Feb_2022_06.jpg/330px-Times_Sq_Feb_2022_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramount_Skydance","wikidata":"Q135485147"},{"title":"Paramount Pictures","blocks":[{"text":"Paramount Pictures Corporation, commonly known as Paramount Pictures or simply Paramount, is an American film studio and distribution arm of Skydance Motion Pictures, itself a division of Skydance Corporation. Founded on May 8, 1912, it is the sixth-oldest global film studio and the second-oldest in the United States behind Universal Pictures, and it is one of the \"Big Four\" film studios."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Paramount_Pictures_with_Skydance_byline.svg/330px-Paramount_Pictures_with_Skydance_byline.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramount_Pictures","wikidata":"Q159846"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Paramountpicturesmelrosegate.jpg/500px-Paramountpicturesmelrosegate.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wi